# Online Education Website

This project is an online education platform designed to make learning accessible and flexible for both students and educators. The platform allows **teachers** to upload, manage, and organize video-based courses, while **students** can engage by liking and commenting on the content.

---

## 🔗 View Live
[**Click Here to View Live**](#)  
*(_Note: We will be uploading the live version soon_)*

---

## 🚀 Features

### 🎓 For Teachers
* **Registration & Login**: Secure access for educators to manage their profile.
* **Video Management**: Easily upload, edit, and delete course videos.
* **Course Creation**: Organize multiple videos into cohesive learning modules.

### 📖 For Students
* **Registration & Login**: Students must register to track progress and access courses.
* **Course Engagement**: Like videos and leave comments to interact with instructors.
* **Comment Management**: Full control to edit or delete personal comments.

### 📱 General Features
* **Responsive Design**: Optimized for desktops, tablets, and mobile phones.
* **User-Friendly Interface**: Clean and simple navigation for a smooth learning experience.

---

## 🛠 Technology Stack

| Component | Technology |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Frontend** | HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript |
| **Backend** | PHP (Server-side scripting) |
| **Database** | MySQL |
| **Tools** | XAMPP / WAMP |

